### status: illustrative-only
### public: false
### authRequired: true
### sessionAuthRequired: true
### tenantScopedHeadersRequired: false
### destructive: true
### requiresTenantHeaders: false
### llmOperational: false
### referenceOnly: true
### runtimeRecordConfirmed: false
### selectorConfirmed: true
### publishedBackendConfirmed: false
### knownPublishedFailure: false
### accessMode: authenticated-session
### selectionGuidance: reference-only-bulk-atomic-execution
### note: Illustrative ATOMIC protected flow. Requires approved deployment, current grants, policy and real authorized IDs; no published-host confirmation.

@baseUrl = https://praxis-api-quickstart.onrender.com
@bearerToken = replace-with-authorized-token
@xsrfToken = replace-with-XSRF-TOKEN-cookie-value-when-csrf-enabled
@proposalId = replace-with-reviewed-proposal-uuid
@executionId = replace-with-retained-execution-uuid
@idempotencyKey = replace-with-one-stable-client-key
@size = 200
@next = replace-with-opaque-next-from-previous-results-page

### When CSRF is enabled, GET /actuator/health first, verify its Set-Cookie XSRF-TOKEN response header, and retain that cookie. Copy that raw cookie value into xsrfToken; keep the cookie and matching header on every POST. Bearer authentication and current grants remain required. Omit the CSRF cookie/header lines only when the host disables CSRF.
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json


### Evaluation captures a protected proposal without mutating domain rows. Obtain target IDs and opaque expectedVersion from authorized current reads.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/operations/missao-participantes/bulk/update-atomic/evaluation
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}
Cookie: XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrfToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}

< ../../payloads/operations/missao_participantes_bulk_atomic_evaluation.json

### Read summary and every proposal results page before confirmation. Use only the returned opaque next as after, with the same principal and size.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/operations/missao-participantes/bulk/proposals/{{proposalId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### Continue with the separately authorized results request.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/operations/missao-participantes/bulk/proposals/{{proposalId}}/results?size={{size}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### Repeat only while next is returned; replace next with that exact opaque value for each subsequent page.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/operations/missao-participantes/bulk/proposals/{{proposalId}}/results?size={{size}}&after={{next}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### Confirm only the reviewed proposal. Retry uncertainty with the same proposal and Idempotency-Key.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/operations/missao-participantes/bulk/update-atomic
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}
Cookie: XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrfToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}

< ../../payloads/operations/missao_participantes_bulk_atomic_confirmation.json

### Read current authorized state and every result page; 200/202 is not proof that the whole ATOMIC set committed. A failed set must not leave partial domain commits.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/operations/missao-participantes/bulk/executions/{{executionId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### Continue with the separately authorized results request.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/operations/missao-participantes/bulk/executions/{{executionId}}/results?size={{size}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### Repeat only while next is returned, preserving principal and size. Read back domain rows under current authorization.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/operations/missao-participantes/bulk/executions/{{executionId}}/results?size={{size}}&after={{next}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### ATOMIC cancellation requests durable admission through control and may prevent a set not yet admitted. An in-progress set may still commit; the request does not compensate a committed set. Reconcile the terminal receipt, every result page, and authorized domain readback before any new proposal.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/operations/missao-participantes/bulk/executions/{{executionId}}/cancel
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}
Cookie: XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrfToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}
